{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-010",
    "title": "下山旧路"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_058",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "顾长离走在前方，脚步很稳，像早已决定不把后路当成选择。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "卯时，山雾尚未散尽。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1354,
          "end": 1354
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临带着沈砚秋给的铜钥匙，来到外门档房。档房在演武坪后方，门窗都用厚木封了半边，只留一道窄缝透气。门上没有匾额，只有一枚褪色的朱印，印文被磨去一角。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1356,
          "end": 1356
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他敲了三下门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1358,
          "end": 1358
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "里面传来拖椅子的声音。一个头发花白的老者探出脸来，先看钥匙，再看陆照临的木牌。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1360,
          "end": 1360
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈执事让你来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1362,
          "end": 1362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1364,
          "end": 1364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三架，最底层，只看写着西坡的卷宗。看完放回原处。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1366,
          "end": 1366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果卷宗少了呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1368,
          "end": 1368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老者看了他一眼：“那就当它从来没有在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1370,
          "end": 1370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "档房内弥漫着霉味与干燥墨香。三排木架从地面一直顶到屋梁，卷宗按年份和院落分列。陆照临找到第三架，最底层只有七卷，封皮上的“西坡”二字大多被水浸过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1372,
          "end": 1372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一卷记载旧阵维修，第二卷记载药圃移栽，第三卷是夜巡轮值。翻到第四卷时，他看见一张补录纸，日期正是三年前冬至前七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1374,
          "end": 1374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "纸上写着：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1376,
          "end": 1376
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“引灯人陆沉舟，奉命送灯至西坡旧井。同行三人，名录另附。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1378,
          "end": 1378
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "名录处却是一片空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1380,
          "end": 1380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把纸举到窗缝的光里。纸纤维没有被撕过，空白像是原本就没有写字。然而纸张边缘残留着极浅的灰白印痕，和废井石片上的纹路相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1382,
          "end": 1382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他继续往后翻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1384,
          "end": 1384
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯未归，旧井封闭。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1386,
          "end": 1386
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "下一页被整齐裁掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1388,
          "end": 1388
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临按住裁口，发现纸背粘着一小块薄薄的铜箔。铜箔上刻着半个名字：叶——。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1390,
          "end": 1390
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外忽然响起脚步。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1392,
          "end": 1392
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老者在架外咳了一声：“别动其他卷。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1394,
          "end": 1394
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把铜箔夹进袖中，回头看去。沈砚秋站在门口，身旁还跟着顾长离。顾长离的脸色比平日更冷，手里握着一封没有封口的信。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1396,
          "end": 1396
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你找到什么？”沈砚秋问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1398,
          "end": 1398
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟确实来过西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1400,
          "end": 1400
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这点我没有否认。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1402,
          "end": 1402
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“同行三人是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1404,
          "end": 1404
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名录被裁掉了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1406,
          "end": 1406
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1408,
          "end": 1408
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“旧档整理时出错。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1410,
          "end": 1410
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前的卷宗，为什么现在还在整理？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1412,
          "end": 1412
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有回答。她走到木架前，手指掠过封皮，最后停在第四卷的裁口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1414,
          "end": 1414
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你父亲不是玄霄宗弟子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1416,
          "end": 1416
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他奉命送灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1418,
          "end": 1418
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“引灯人受宗门雇佣，不计入弟子名册。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1420,
          "end": 1420
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那为什么要把同行者的名字裁掉？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1422,
          "end": 1422
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋回头看他：“因为他们没有回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1424,
          "end": 1424
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“和陆沉舟一样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1426,
          "end": 1426
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只确认三个人都失踪。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1428,
          "end": 1428
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离打开手里的信：“我查到一件事。三年前冬至前七日，顾氏旁支也有三名账房离开北地，目的地写的是无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1430,
          "end": 1430
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向她：“无灯镇在旧驿道上？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1432,
          "end": 1432
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第一站。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1434,
          "end": 1434
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋的神情骤然变得严厉：“你们不准下山。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1436,
          "end": 1436
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封山令还要多久？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1438,
          "end": 1438
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“至少七日。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1440,
          "end": 1440
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“七日足够有人把镇上的记录烧干净。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1442,
          "end": 1442
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把信从她手里抽走：“你家族的账，不要牵连玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1444,
          "end": 1444
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它已经牵连了。”顾长离说，“账上有玄霄宗的印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1446,
          "end": 1446
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "档房里一阵沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1448,
          "end": 1448
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁的债？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1468,
          "end": 1468
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让它自己走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1658,
          "end": 1658
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "小灯沿水道漂出十几丈，在一道石门前停住。石门没有门缝，门面却有半枚青白色印记。陆照临掌心的残印随之发热，门后的黑暗里传来轻轻的敲击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1660,
          "end": 1660
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1662,
          "end": 1662
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1664,
          "end": 1664
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三声响起时，石门缓缓向外开启。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1666,
          "end": 1666
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门后不是山脚，而是一段向下延伸的旧石阶。石阶尽头透出微弱天光，天光旁立着一块歪斜木牌：无灯镇。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1668,
          "end": 1668
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人比我们先到。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1670,
          "end": 1670
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "木牌下方留着新鲜脚印，脚印左外侧有一道缺口，正是第四章杂木林里那行湿脚印的纹路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1672,
          "end": 1672
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临握紧普通引路灯，却没有点燃。他和顾长离沿石阶下行，身后的石门在最后一人通过后自行合拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1674,
          "end": 1674
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山门方向，封山钟忽然响了一声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1676,
          "end": 1676
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "同一时刻，玄霄宗的公告栏上多出一张新的追捕令。画像上的人没有脸，只有姓名：陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1678,
          "end": 1678
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "而无灯镇的第一户人家，门前挂着一盏熄灭了三年的灯，正在雨里轻轻摇晃。\n陆照临回头看了一眼已经合拢的石门。门上没有锁，也没有封条，只有那半枚印记在黑暗里一闪一闪。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1680,
          "end": 1681
        }
      }
    ],
